msgstr "Ich habe sie gekocht!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ALOE_PLANTED"
