msgstr "Geh weg! Such dir dein eigenes Wasser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEASACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEASACK"
