msgstr "Tja, so viel dazu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
