msgstr "Oho, da leuchten meine Augen aber!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN"
