msgstr "Ganz schön praktisch zur Goldsuche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST"
