msgstr "Braucht unbedingt Dünger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
