msgstr "Lasset das Kochen beginnen!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY"
