msgstr "Eine luxuriöse aber gefährliche Zutat!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL_COOKED"
