msgstr "Eine schöne Spezies!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.SLEEPING"
