msgstr "Fürs Erste friedlich."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE"
