msgstr "Süße Träume, Federvieh."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA"
