msgstr "Worauf wartet er?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.DEAD"
