#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
