msgstr "Die Stile wachsen wieder nach."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC"
