#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
