msgstr "Mmh, das Aroma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBOT"
