msgstr "Macht Kaffee!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN"
