msgstr "Wir sind so fein, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI.BURNING"
