#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_TINKER.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_TINKER.BURNING"
