msgstr "Das Holz gefällt mir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET"
