#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT"
