msgstr "Nicht ins Lager kacken!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_ENTRANCE"
