#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON"
