#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG"
