msgstr "Schöne Maserung."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_BASIC"
