msgstr "Nicht gerade mein Lieblingsessen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
