msgstr "Ganz ruhig!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
