msgstr "Ein glühendes Schwert!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
