#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL"
