#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT"
