msgstr "Das Ding wird heiß!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN"
