msgstr "Fischfutter!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.GENERIC"
