msgstr "Arrr! Finger weg von meinem Gold!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT"
