msgstr "Das soll Trockenfleisch sein?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED"
