msgstr "Verheddert sich in meinen Seilen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK"
