msgstr "Schönes Stückchen Seegemüse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS"
