msgstr "Schutz vor den Wellen."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH"
