#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW"
