msgstr "Ich mag meine Kartoffeln süß."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED"
