msgstr "Ein zukünftiger Schiffsmast."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT"
